{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T07:39:37+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T07:39:37+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"LACROIX Group SA","sector":"Technology","industry":"Scientific & Technical Instruments","country":"France","city":"Saint-Herblain","website":"https://www.lacroix-group.com","employees":2807,"summary":"LACROIX Group SA engages in the design and manufacture of electronic equipment and industrial IoT solutions in France, Germany, the United States, Poland, and Tunisia. It operates through two segments, LACROIX Electronics and LACROIX Environment. The company designs and manufactures industrial IoT solutions comprising hardware equipment, embedded software, and cloud services; and electronic equipment for the automotive, industrial, home and building automation, aerospace and defense, and healthcare sectors. It also offers equipment and solutions to optimize the control, operation, and performance of water networks, heating, ventilation and air conditioning systems, and smart grids and lighting. LACROIX Group SA was founded in 1936 and is headquartered in Saint-Herblain, France.","exchange":"Paris","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"LACROIX Group SA s’engage dans la conception et la fabrication d’équipements électroniques et de solutions IoT industrielles en France, en Allemagne, aux États-Unis, en Pologne et en Tunisie. Elle opère à travers deux segments, LACROIX Electronics et LACROIX Environment. La société conçoit et fabrique des solutions IoT industrielles comprenant des équipements matériels, des logiciels embarqués et des services cloud; et des équipements électroniques pour les secteurs de l'automobile, de l'industrie, de la domotique, de l'aérospatiale et de la défense, et de la santé."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":74381624,"shares_outstanding":4722643,"trailing_pe":4.984177,"forward_pe":4.090909,"price_to_book